# Direct Python dependencies for the ai-stack ingestion worker.
#
# This is the human-maintained input; the deployable artifact is the adjacent
# requirements.txt — a fully pinned, hashed, universal lock compiled with
# `make ingestion-worker-lock` (uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes).
# Edit ranges here, then recompile; never hand-edit requirements.txt.
#
# The install-deps initContainer uses this file directly ONLY when
# ingestionWorker.sources.pipPackages adds fsspec backends: pip hash-checking
# is all-or-nothing, so the unhashed backends must be co-resolved with these
# ranges in one pass (a conflicting backend fails at build, not at runtime).
#
# Upper bounds pin the major version so that resolve cannot pull a breaking
# major release without a deliberate chart change (supply-chain determinism,
# consistent with ADR-002's image-pinning posture).
